/* Sec.3 forward rotation:  u_d = c*u_dc + s*u_qc ,  u_q = -s*u_dc + c*u_qc.
 * Inverse recovers u_dc:  c*u_d - s*u_q = (c^2+s^2)*u_dc = u_dc,  using c^2+s^2=1. */
Problem
  \forall c \forall s \forall udc \forall uqc
  ( c^2 + s^2 = 1
    -> c*(c*udc + s*uqc) - s*(-s*udc + c*uqc) = udc )
End.
